@@ -877,6 +877,12 @@ The default colors are:
 	Adjusts the opacity of the window between 0 (completely transparent) and
 	1 (completely opaque). If the operation is omitted, _set_ will be used.
 
+*tabs_render_hidden* yes|no
+	When enabled, hidden children of tabbed and stacked containers are still
+	rendered underneath the focused child, so a translucent window shows the
+	tab behind it instead of the wallpaper. Hidden children keep receiving
+	frame events, which costs extra rendering. Default is _no_.
+
 *tiling_drag*  enable|disable|toggle
 	Sets whether or not tiling containers can be dragged with the mouse. If
 	_enabled_ (default), the _floating_mod_ can be used to drag tiling, as well
